{"name":"StreamedWorld","kind":"component","module":"world","doc":"Streams a <code>.world</code>&#39;s cells into play around the players (<code>ara-runtime-world</code>). Put it on one entity of the level scene; the cell documents stay out of the projection and arrive at tick boundaries. With a <code>Terrain</code>, navigation then follows the resident <code>TerrainChunk</code>s.","fields":[{"name":"world","typeHtml":"option&lt;asset&lt;world&gt;&gt;","doc":"The world manifest (<code>.world</code> document).","default":"null"}],"variants":[],"usedBy":{"types":[],"commands":[]},"usage":[{"label":"Add it","html":"<pre class=\"shiki ara\" style=\"background-color:var(--code-background);color:var(--code-fg)\" tabindex=\"0\"><code><span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:var(--code-fg)\">ara </span><span style=\"color:var(--code-keyword)\">do</span><span style=\"color:var(--code-fg)\"> component.add </span><span style=\"color:var(--code-keyword)\">-</span><span style=\"color:var(--code-fg)\">p entity</span><span style=\"color:var(--code-keyword)\">=</span><span style=\"color:var(--code-fg)\">name:Crate </span><span style=\"color:var(--code-keyword)\">-</span><span style=\"color:var(--code-fg)\">p component</span><span style=\"color:var(--code-keyword)\">=</span><span style=\"color:var(--code-fg)\">StreamedWorld </span><span style=\"color:var(--code-keyword)\">--</span><span style=\"color:var(--code-fg)\">why </span><span style=\"color:var(--code-string)\">\"Add StreamedWorld\"</span></span></code></pre>"},{"label":"Set a field","html":"<pre class=\"shiki ara\" style=\"background-color:var(--code-background);color:var(--code-fg)\" tabindex=\"0\"><code><span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:var(--code-fg)\">ara </span><span style=\"color:var(--code-keyword)\">do</span><span style=\"color:var(--code-fg)\"> property.set </span><span style=\"color:var(--code-keyword)\">-</span><span style=\"color:var(--code-fg)\">p entity</span><span style=\"color:var(--code-keyword)\">=</